# Process Flow Diagram

## Online Order Management System: To-Be Flow

```text
START
  ↓
Customer Login
  ↓
Search & Select Product
  ↓
Select Quantity & Check Availability
  ↓
Buy Now or Add to Cart?
  ├── Add to Cart → Product Added to Cart ──┐
  └── Buy Now ──────────────────────────────┤
                                            ↓
                                  Delivery Information
                                            ↓
                                      Online Payment
                                            ↓
                                  Order Placed & Order ID
                                            ↓
                              Store & Delivery Partner Notified
                                            ↓
                                  Order Processed & Delivered
                                            ↓
                                      Status Updated
                                            ↓
                                  Return / Refund Request
                                            ↓
                                  Return / Refund Processed
                                            ↓
                                           END